## Delivery paths

| Artifact | Path |
|----------|------|
| Manifest | **`idea-stage/research-refine.manifest.result.json`** (`aris_phase`: **`research-refine` only**) |
| Phase 5 | **`refine-logs/FINAL_PROPOSAL.md`**, **`refine-logs/REVIEW_SUMMARY.md`**, **`refine-logs/REFINEMENT_REPORT.md`**, **`refine-logs/REFINE_STATE.json`** |
| Phase 1 | **`refine-logs/round-0-initial-proposal.md`** |
| Loop | **`refine-logs/round-N-review.md`**; **`refine-logs/round-N-refinement.md`** when Phase 3 ran |

**Wrong paths (ignore / move files):** `idea-stage/refine-logs/*`, `idea-stage/FINAL_PROPOSAL.md`, manifest under `refine-logs/`.

## result

**Delivery only.** **`success` = upstream Phase 5 finished** (not “first review done”).

- `"success"` — **`1 ≤ summary.rounds_completed ≤ 5`** and **`summary.max_review_rounds` = 5**; no `round-{N}-review.md` for N > 5; Phase 5 files + `round-0-initial-proposal.md`; review/refinement files match **`exited_after_review`** rules above; `REFINE_STATE`: `phase: done`, `status: completed`, `round` = `rounds_completed`; `FINAL_PROPOSAL` H2s; idea-creator title match if present.
- `"failed"` — interrupted loop or Phase 5 incomplete; keep `in_progress` state for resume.

## Top-level fields

| Field | Value |
|-------|--------|
| summary.rounds_completed | Last **review** index R (**1 ≤ R ≤ 5**, equals upstream MAX_ROUNDS cap) |
| summary.max_review_rounds | **Must be 5** for success (documents cap; matches upstream `MAX_ROUNDS`) |
| summary.exited_after_review | **true** if loop stopped right after `round-R-review` (upstream STOP or max rounds without Phase 3 for R) |
| summary.final_verdict / final_score / problem_anchor_one_liner | non-empty for success |

## deliverables

Same paths as Example JSON; Phase 5 trio required for success.

---

## Authoring: Phase 5 files

**`FINAL_PROPOSAL.md`** — clean final proposal (English unless project requires otherwise). Required H2: Problem Anchor, Technical Gap, Method Thesis, Contribution Focus, Proposed Method, Claim-Driven Validation Sketch, Experiment Handoff Inputs, Compute & Timeline Estimate.

**`REVIEW_SUMMARY.md`** — per upstream Phase 5.1 (Problem Anchor, Round-by-Round log, Final Status).

**`REFINEMENT_REPORT.md`** — per upstream Phase 5.3; point to `/experiment-plan` as next step.

